{"id":"059acbe8570b41df","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-cor-tree.md","title":"Aronszajn Tree Corollary","display":"cor-tree — Aronszajn Tree Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-tree","aliases":["58-cor-tree"],"display":"cor-tree — Aronszajn Tree Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-thm-aronszajn]]","[[58-df-tree-property]]","[[58-df-omega1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-tree — Aronszajn Tree Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4\" href=\"?note=aa9cb1cb7b132eb4\" title=\"58-thm-aronszajn\">58-thm-aronszajn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> is the first uncountable ordinal (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"58-df-omega1\">58-df-omega1</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ZFC proves the existence of an Aronszajn tree.</li>\n<li>This is the exact <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-tree/canonical-cofinal-branch signature used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4\" href=\"?note=aa9cb1cb7b132eb4\" title=\"58-thm-aronszajn\">58-thm-aronszajn</a>; no local height or level primitives are introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-aronszajn","status":"resolved","id":"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-aronszajn]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega1]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega1","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1$ is the first uncountable ordinal (see [[58-df-omega1]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S$ and $\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-tree-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-aronszajn","status":"resolved","id":"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This is the exact $\\omega_1$-tree/canonical-cofinal-branch signature used by [[58-thm-aronszajn]]; no local height or level primitives are introduced.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\exists T,R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\omega_1)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\omega_1)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":887,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-cor-tree.md|58-cor-tree]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["aa9cb1cb7b132eb4","e72a83d57cf9c8fb","27ae6ad867a7007d"]}